repository-code: 'https://github.com/anazcodes/gopkg'
abstract: >-
  A collection of reusable, robust Go packages and utilities designed to
  accelerate backend development. Includes utilities for HTTP clients, 
  OpenTelemetry, Postgres type extensions, logging, and retry mechanisms.
